msgstr "95%%置信区间下界必须小于上界。"

msgid "You cannot set all the prior model probabilties to zero."
msgstr "您不能将所有先验模型概率都设为零。"

msgid "The model could not be fit. Please check the following: Do you have at least n=2 studies? If the prior is truncated, is it consistent with the data (when most effect sizes are negative, the analysis may not work when the prior is constrained to be postive)?"
msgstr "模型无法拟合。请检查以下内容：您是否有至少n=2个研究？如果先验被截断，它是否与数据一致（当大多数效应量为负时，如果先验被约束为正，分析可能无法工作）？"

