msgstr "调整后估计"

msgid "Each marginal mean estimate is averaged across the levels of the remaining predictors."
msgstr "每个边际均值估计是在其余预测变量的各水平上取平均得到的。"

msgid "Each marginal mean estimate is averaged across the levels of the remaining predictors in a given subgroup."
msgstr "每个边际均值估计是在给定亚组中其余预测变量的各水平上取平均得到的。"

msgid "NAs in the marginal mean estimates were introduced due to the %1$s transformation. Please verify that you are using the correct effect size transformation."
msgstr "由于%1$s变换，边际均值估计中引入了缺失值。请确认您使用的是正确的效应量变换。"

msgid "The marginal mean estimates and intervals are transformed using %1$s transformation. For nonlinear transformations, transformed marginal means are interpreted as medians on the transformed scale."
msgstr "边际均值估计和区间使用%1$s变换进行转换。对于非线性变换，转换后的边际均值被解释为变换尺度上的中位数。"

msgid "The estimates and intervals correspond to %1$s."
msgstr "估计和区间对应于%1$s。"

msgid "Each contrast is averaged across the levels of the remaining predictors."
msgstr "每个对比在其余预测变量的各水平上取平均。"

msgid "Contrasts of estimates marginal means cannot be transformed via the effect size transformation."
msgstr "估计边际均值的对比不能通过效应量变换进行转换。"

msgid "Contrasts of estimated marginal means are adjusted for multiple comparisons using %1$s correction."
msgstr "估计边际均值的对比使用%1$s校正进行多重比较调整。"

msgid "Contrasts of estimated marginal means cannot be transformed via the link function. As such, the contrasts are summarized on the model scale: log(𝜏²)."
msgstr "估计边际均值的对比无法通过链接函数进行转换。因此，对比在模型尺度上汇总：log(𝜏²)。"

msgid "Contrasts of estimated marginal means cannot be transformed via the heterogeneity transformation. As such, the contrasts are summarized as 𝜏²."
msgstr "估计边际均值的对比无法通过异质性变换进行转换。因此，对比汇总为𝜏²。"

