msgstr "为'%1$s'加载的距离矩阵与数据集不匹配。缺少以下水平：%2$s。"

msgid "The loaded correlation matrix for '%1$s' does not match the dataset. The following levels are missing: %2$s."
msgstr "为'%1$s'加载的相关矩阵与数据集不匹配。缺少以下水平：%2$s。"

