msgid "Warning:"
msgstr "警告："

msgid "Cluster-robust inference has very low effective degrees of freedom. When Satterthwaite df < 4, p-values should be interpreted with extreme caution."
msgstr "聚类稳健推断的有效自由度非常低。当Satterthwaite自由度df < 4时，应极为谨慎地解释p值。"

msgid "Knapp-Hartung inference is based on very few residual degrees of freedom; results can be sensitive and should be interpreted cautiously."
msgstr "Knapp-Hartung推断基于很少的残差自由度；结果可能敏感，应谨慎解释。"

msgid "The model estimation failed with the following message: %1$s. Please, consider simplifying the model."
msgstr "模型估计失败，错误信息为：%1$s。请考虑简化模型。"

msgid "The cluster-robust standard errors could not be computed. Please, consider modifying the clustering settings in the 'Advanced' section."
msgstr "无法计算聚类稳健标准误。请考虑在“高级”部分修改聚类设置。"

msgid "Fewer than two estimates."
msgstr "估计少于两个。"

msgid "The selected 'Method' requires specification of the 'Weights' option in the 'Advanced' section."
msgstr "选定的“方法”要求在“高级”部分指定“权重”选项。"

msgid "The GLMM could not be estimated for the selected model. This can happen with sparse event counts, risk differences, random study effects, or a moderator structure that is too complex for the data. Try simplifying the moderator model, using the fixed study-effects GLMM, changing the effect-size measure if appropriate, or centering/scaling continuous moderators.\n\nMetafor reported: Cannot fit ML model."
msgstr "无法为所选模型估计GLMM。这可能在稀疏事件数、风险差、随机研究效应或对数据而言过于复杂的调节变量结构时发生。请尝试简化调节变量模型、使用固定研究效应GLMM、酌情更改效应量度量，或对连续调节变量进行中心化/缩放。\\n\\nMetafor报告：无法拟合ML模型。"

